    "architecture_impact": "diagram_change",
    "impact_reason": "Integrated operator review presentation and authenticated repair add six native source-linked Function nodes and eight Code relationships. Existing component views retain Watchdog-to-Task observation, Epic-to-Workspace queue, Boss-to-Watchdog postcheck and Watchdog-to-Feature verification. This review corrects scalar-bound descriptions against production behavior and links terminal source persistence. Context/container/store and existing component ownership are unchanged. The reviewed plan explicitly retains Feature 5 delivery-consumer/cross-Feature acceptance plus the unfulfilled bounded-evidence requirement; publishing current architecture does not assert completion. Historical pending requests and accepted snapshots remain intact. Current source kinds, owners, references and confined pinned render validate; browser verification and exact measured results are recorded separately. Warm browser verification passed 13 paths across eight Code views, deep-link/source/Level-up and the four retained relationships in both component views with unchanged render-operation count; the cold readiness timeout remains an explicit runtime limitation."
